```

## Configuration Management
- Use environment variables for deployment-specific config
- YAML files for complex configuration
- Validate configuration at startup
- Support multiple environments (dev, staging, prod)

## Monitoring and Observability
- Structured logging with correlation IDs
- Prometheus metrics for key business metrics
- Distributed tracing with OpenTelemetry
- Health checks for readiness and liveness probes
- gRPC reflection for development

## Security Considerations
- Input validation at handler level
- Authentication and authorization middleware
- TLS for production deployments
- Rate limiting and request timeouts
- Audit logging for sensitive operations

This structure ensures maintainable, testable, and scalable gRPC services following industry best practices.
